101
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:15,080
And more than that, it's about an obdurate desire to get our own way and resist repentance

102
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:19,500
and to bring God back our direction instead of us going his way.

103
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:26,440
