106
00:27:32,780 --> 00:27:34,900
repent, which is an unexpected turn.

107
00:27:34,900 --> 00:27:36,740
It's a very unique story.

108
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:42,960
To get everybody on the same page, the story in brief, it's a very short story, carefully

